### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "qwe",
    "password": "qwe"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### teste de inserção de piquete
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPiquete HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "piqueteid": 0,
    "descricao": "Piquete 04",
    "latitude": -20.4310000,
    "longitude": -49.9835000,
    "pastoidfk": 2,
    "removido": false
}

### teste de buscar todos os piquetes
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPiquetes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar piquete por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getPiqueteByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar pastos para piquete
GET http://localhost:40000/getPastosToPiquete HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de atualização de piquete
PUT http://localhost:40000/updatePiquete/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete 01 Atualizado",
    "latitude": -20.4238000,
    "longitude": -49.9782000,
    "pastoidfk": 1,
    "removido": false
}

### teste de remoção de piquete
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deletePiquete/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
